// Episode-12 Logical DB Query & Compound Indexes

// you can add connectionRequestusing Array for all the users 
// This is not a good design 
//some people can reject ,so many corner cases are there 
// keep it away from user collection
//user Schema was defining the schema of user 

// How to put indes in the database 

//There  are 1000 people 
// connectsrequest 1000 records 
// as my connection grows 
// my query will become very very slow
// when you scale the database ,it becomes difficult for it 
//use index it become easy for it 

// 1 million records 
// 100 people name with virat 
// when you are doinf search query 
// my db will take 5-10 sec 
// db will take to look into each and every 
// if you create index in the first index 
// your query will become very very fast


